  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- そびえ{立|た}つ: to stand towering (emphatic compound)\n- ⟦{山|やま}→山：02168_yama⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧そびえる: a mountain towers\n- ⟦{空|そら}→空：02216_sora⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧そびえる: to tower into the sky\n\nUSAGE: Often used in the compound そびえ{立|た}つ for extra emphasis. The て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ form is most natural for describing a state of standing tall. Carries a sense of grandeur and impressiveness.",
